{"articleNo":"502559","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=502559&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2024 학생 창업자 지원 [기간연장]","writer":"기술창업지원실","writeDate":"2024.11.27","hit":"29167","attachments":[{"name":"2024 학생 창업자 지원 명단(제출용).xlsx","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=502559&attachNo=139172"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; word-break: keep-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 25pt;\">2024&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-weight: bold; font-size: 25pt;\">학생 창업자 지원</span></p><p class=\"0\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">안녕하세요</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">국립금오공과대학교 기술창업지원실 창업지원팀입니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">산학협력단</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">(LINC3.0&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">사업단</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">지원으로 창업지원팀에서 재학생</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">휴학생</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">들의 창업 활성화를 위하여&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">2024</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">년도 학생 창업자들에 대한 창업지원비를 지원하고자 합니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">상세 내용은 아래와 같습니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold;\">■&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-weight: bold;\">지 원 대 상&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold;\">: 2024.03.01. ~ 2025.02.28.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-weight: bold;\">해당 기간에 창업한 재학생 및 휴학생</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">※&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">미창업자 중&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">25.02. 28&nbsp;까지&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">사업자등록을 할 창업예정자도 포함</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">■&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-weight: bold;\">제 출 서 류</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">-&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">사업자등록증 사본&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">부</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">-&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">엑셀 파일</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">이름</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">학과</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">학번</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">연락처 및 창업한 기업에 관한 정보 기재 등</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">) 1</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">부</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\"></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">■</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-weight: bold;\">접 수 기 한&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold;\">:</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">2025. 03. 07.(</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">금</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">까지 (기간연장)</span></p><p class=\"0\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">■</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-weight: bold;\">제 출 방 법&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">이메일 제출&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">rnwldms92@kumoh.ac.kr</span></p><p class=\"0\"><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.8pt;\">*</span></u><u><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: -0.8pt;\">첨부파일의 엑셀 파일 다운로드 후 해당 엑셀 내용 작성하여 사업자등록증과 같이 제출해주세요</span></u><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.8pt;\">.</span></u></p><p class=\"0\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">■&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-weight: bold;\">지 원 내 용&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold;\">:</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-weight: bold;\">최대&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold;\">500,000</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-weight: bold;\">원 상당의 상품권</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-weight: bold;\">생활협동조합</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">■&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-weight: bold;\">지 급 방 법&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold;\">:</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">생활협동조합 상품권으로 추후 개별적 제공</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">서명부에 서명 후 수령</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-weight: bold;\">선착순 지급예정&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold;\">-&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-weight: bold;\">상품권의 경우 생활협동조합 상품권&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold;\">5</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-weight: bold;\">천원권으로 지급</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">최대&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">500,000</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">원이며 사업 유형에 따라 차등 지급함에 따라 해당 금액은 변경될 수 있습니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">.)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">■&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-weight: bold;\">상품권 수령 기한&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold;\">:&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">2025. 03. 31.(<font face=\"함초롬바탕\">월</font></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">) 18:00</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">까지</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">*</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">수령 기한이 지나면 상품권 수령 불가함을 사전 공지드립니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">■&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-weight: bold;\">상품권 수령 장소&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">벤처창업관&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">313</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">호</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;\">■&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-weight: bold;\">상품권</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.2pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-weight: bold;\">수령 가능 시간대&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-weight: bold;\">:&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.2pt;\">9:30 ~ 17:30</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">단</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">, 11:40 ~ 13:00</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">까지는 점심시간으로 방문 불가</span></p><p class=\"0\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold;\">[<font face=\"함초롬바탕\">선착순 지급으로 조기 마감될 수 있습니다.</font></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold;\">]</span></p><p class=\"0\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">○&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">문의 및 연락처</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">:&nbsp; 054-478-7897~8,&nbsp; rnwldms92@kumoh.ac.kr</span></p><p class=\"0\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p><div id=\"hwpEditorBoardContent\" class=\"hwp_editor_board_content\" data-hjsonver=\"1.0\" data-jsonlen=\"26684\"></div><p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-decoration: none; list-style: none; margin: 0px; padding: 10px 0px 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; text-size-adjust: none; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 300; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
